.TH mnnn-model-record-list 1  "mnnn-model-record-list 2.7.0" 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH NAME
mnnn\-model\-record\-list \- List records: filter, find text, sort, group and page
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmnnn model record list\fR [\fB\-\-home\fR] [\fB\-\-where\fR] [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-text\fR] [\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR] [\fB\-\-sort\fR] [\fB\-\-group\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-\-agg\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-\-limit\fR] [\fB\-y\fR|\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-\-offset\fR] [\fB\-\-theme\-mode\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIMODEL\fR> 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH DESCRIPTION
List records: filter, find text, sort, group and page
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-home\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Muninn home directory (default ~/.muninn)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_HOME\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-where\fR \fI<COND>\fR
FIELD OP VALUE (repeatable; ops = != ~ !~ > >= < <=, ? present, !? missing)
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Database file (default <home>/storage/muninn.database)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_DB\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-text\fR \fI<TEXT>\fR
Text found in any field
.TP
\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR
Never prompt; missing values are errors
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_NON_INTERACTIVE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-sort\fR \fI<SORT>\fR
FIELD, \-FIELD or FIELD:desc (comma\-separated or repeated)
.TP
\fB\-\-group\fR \fI<GROUP>\fR
Group by these fields (comma\-separated or repeated)
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
More output (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-\-agg\fR \fI<AGG>\fR
With \-\-group: sum:F, avg:F, min:F or max:F (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Print nothing but errors and requested data
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_QUIET\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-limit\fR \fI<LIMIT>\fR
At most this many (bars: 50 unless given; 0 = all)
.TP
\fB\-y\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR
Answer yes to every confirmation
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_YES\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-offset\fR \fI<OFFSET>\fR [default: 0]

.TP
\fB\-\-theme\-mode\fR \fI<THEME_MODE>\fR
Override the theme mode for this run
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
light
.IP \(bu 2
dark
.IP \(bu 2
system
.RE
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_THEME_MODE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIMODEL\fR>

.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH VERSION
v2.7.0
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBmnnn\fR(1)
